# wake — RETIRED 2026-04-30 per raw 213 (cli-osascript-shell-out-os-escalation-ban-mandate)
# ============================================================
# Sleep prevention is now driven from the airgenome.app menubar via in-process
# IOPMAssertionCreateWithName(kIOPMAssertionTypeNoIdleSleep) — no LaunchAgent,
# no caffeinate indirection, no admin escalation. The legacy LaunchAgent
# (com.airgenome.wake running caffeinate -dimsu) is auto-cleaned at first
# launch of the new airgenome.app binary (bootout + plist rm). The CLI surface
# `airgenome wake` is retired — use the menubar "Wake (sleep prevention)"
# toggle. raw 169 surgical: function body + dispatch case + help line removed
# in the same commit; no fallback shim to reduce drift surface.

# Legacy aliases — forward to airgenome tap with a one-line deprecation note.
# raw#21 deprecation pattern: keep referenceable, point to canonical.
